      "value": "https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.xr.arkit-face-tracking@1.0/api/UnityEngine.XR.ARKit.ARKitBlendShapeLocation.html#fields\nHere is a list of blendshapes with the standard PerfectSync\nI think you will have no trouble expressing yourself in face tracking if you have enough of these. (It's a bit excessive)\nIt is said that the number of OSC parameters is not enough to express with OSC.\nTranslated with www.DeepL.com/Translator (free version)",
