      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To add on top of this request, despite there being multiple systems with proprietary facial tracking system, there should be at least a bare minimum in terms of what parameters would be used per system so they can at least match/map onto those systems if they need to be added on later down the line.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
