  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-15T17:07:49.164Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If VRC had internal parameters (not tied to a specific api) we could have full face tracking without flooding the custom parameter list, it could be a tickbox on the avatar descriptor.\nAFK is an example of an internal parameter that can be used and animated without needing to be added to the list of parameters, this can be done for face tracking floats as well.",
